    <detaileddescription>
<para>struct <ref refid="structsg_1_1DefaultHandler" kindref="compound">DefaultHandler</ref></para><para>Base class for <ref refid="structsg_1_1AncestorTypeFinder" kindref="compound">AncestorTypeFinder</ref>. It was probably intended to be a generic BaseClass for many RoseVisitor types, but it isn&apos;t used by anything else, and isn&apos;t actually necessary. If any specific type is not handled by its derived class, <ref refid="structsg_1_1DefaultHandler" kindref="compound">DefaultHandler</ref> provides the function to ignore it. </para>    </detaileddescription>
